rem 2. Sequences and pipelines
use sequences
use numbers

rem Functions follow their data. Read this from left to right.
rem Take the numbers 1 through 10, then add them: 55.
1 to 10 sum

rem Fibonacci is an endless sequence, computed as needed.
rem Take only its first eight values: 1 2 3 5 8 13 21 34.
fibonacci take 8

rem Keep Fibonacci numbers up to 100.
Fib = fibonacci to 100
rem A comparison produces one true or false for each value.
Mask = Fib even
rem Use that mask to select just the even numbers: 2 8 34.
Fib Mask
rem Select, then sum: 44.
Fib Mask sum

rem Try changing 100 to 4000000. The sum becomes 4613732.
